  "title": "BigQuery Reservation Adds Edition Upgrade API",
  "summary": "The BigQuery Reservation API now includes a new `upgradeEdition` method, allowing programmatic upgrades of reservation editions (e.g., Standard to Enterprise). This enables more flexible management of your BigQuery capacity.",
  "details": "A new method, `projects.locations.upgradeEdition`, has been introduced. This method accepts an `UpgradeEditionRequest` which specifies the `targetEdition` (e.g., `ENTERPRISE`, `ENTERPRISE_PLUS`) and a list of `capacityCommitments` and/or `reservations` to upgrade. The API ensures that upgrades are only to higher editions and validates resource requirements before proceeding. This provides a programmatic way to manage your BigQuery reservation tiers.",
